1. Overview

1.1 Purpose

Enable users to generate customized, structured scripts based on their target audience, product information, and content objectives.

1.2 MVP Scope

In Scope

- Script Input Configuration
- Brand Profile Integration
- AI Script Generation
- Structured Script Output
- Edit, Copy, Regenerate
- Credit Management
- Generation History Integration

Out of Scope

- AI Video / Voice Generation
- Automatic Video Editing
- Social Media Publishing
- Video Analytics

