3. User Flow

1. Open Script Generator.
2. Select Brand Profile (Optional).
3. Enter script information.
4. Select objective, platform, tone, language, and duration.
5. Submit generation request.
6. Backend validates inputs and checks credits.
7. AI generates the script.
8. Backend validates and saves the result.
9. Deduct one credit after successful generation.
10. Display the generated script.

4. Functional Requirements

- Users can configure script inputs.
- Users can optionally use Brand Profiles and Custom Tones.
- System generates structured scripts through AI.
- Users can edit and copy generated scripts.
- Users can regenerate scripts.
- Every successful generation costs one credit.
- Failed generation costs zero credits.
- Users can access only their own scripts.

