8. Credit & Business Logic

Action| Credit Cost
Generate| 1
Regenerate| 1
Edit / Copy / History| Free
Failed Generation| 0

- Check balance before generation.
- Deduct only after successful generation.
- Save script and credit transaction consistently.
- Prevent duplicate requests and double deductions.
- Regeneration creates a new record without overwriting the original.

9. Security & Error Handling

- Protect routes with authentication middleware.
- Enforce user ownership on the backend.
- Validate inputs using Laravel Form Requests.
- Keep API keys in server-side environment variables.
- Apply rate limiting and duplicate request protection.
- Handle AI errors, timeouts, invalid responses, and database failures.
- Do not deduct credits for failed generation.

